# APK Monitoring Agent — example crontab entries
#
# Install with: crontab -e (then paste the relevant line)
# Or: crontab <(crontab -l 2>/dev/null; cat scripts/apk-monitor/crontab.example)
#
# Adjust paths to match your installation.
# Logs go to workspace/apk-monitor/runs/cron_*.log

# ── Full pipeline: daily at 3am ──────────────────────────
# Discovers new APKs, scans for BT, launches RE agents, votes, merges
0 3 * * * /path/to/opengreeniot-protocol-docs/scripts/apk-monitor/run_monitor.sh >> /tmp/apk-monitor-cron.log 2>&1

# ── Scan only: every 6 hours ─────────────────────────────
# Lighter-weight: just discover and scan, no API calls
# 0 */6 * * * /path/to/opengreeniot-protocol-docs/scripts/apk-monitor/run_monitor.sh --scan-only >> /tmp/apk-monitor-scan.log 2>&1

# ── Vote on pending candidates: daily at 6am ─────────────
# Re-run voting if you've manually added candidate specs
# 0 6 * * * /path/to/opengreeniot-protocol-docs/scripts/apk-monitor/run_monitor.sh --vote pax-vape >> /tmp/apk-monitor-vote.log 2>&1
